CORE
division.c
--evaluation-order-check _ --div-by-zero-check
^\[main\.division-by-zero\.1\] line 12 division by zero in a / b: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
has no effect on goto binaries
--
With --evaluation-order-check passed to goto-cc, a / b may also be evaluated
before f() sets b to 1, which divides by zero.
